{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"和(范畴论)"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"和 (范畴论)"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>和</strong> (sum), 又叫<strong>余积</strong> (coproduct), 是以集合 (离散范畴) 为指标的"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"积(范畴论)","text":"积 (范畴论)"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}